                <pb facs="0363" n="353" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg353"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894A.00/6–1749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul General at Tientsin</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Tientsin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-06-23T20:00:00-04:00">June 23, 1949—8 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>157. While appreciating force of argument ur 430 June 7 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >21</hi>], Dept believes public statement re Formosa unwise at this
                    time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
